2	//   "Show me how much is still left to pay on each invoice after any payments."
3	//
4	// An invoice now surfaces how much is STILL LEFT TO PAY on it — its amount minus everything that has
5	// been paid against it. On the invoice's own detail page (invoice-detail-page, the child route
6	// /invoices/<id>, which is also where the invoice's payments are shown) a new anchor
7	// (invoice-due-amount) carries that remaining balance:
8	//   - with nothing paid yet, the whole amount is still due;
9	//   - with payments recorded, the remaining is the amount minus the sum of those payments;
10	//   - once payments cover the amount, nothing is left ($0.00).
